# Create this in the Appwrite console: Project Settings -> API Keys -> Create API Key
# Scopes needed: databases.read + documents.read (read-only, no write scopes)
# (console may label the second one "Documents" or "Rows" depending on version)
# NOTE: these vars are deliberately NOT prefixed with APPWRITE_ — that prefix is
# reserved by Appwrite Sites itself (e.g. APPWRITE_SITE_ID is auto-injected as this
# deployment's own Sites resource ID, silently overriding a custom var of that name).
CMS_API_KEY=
